# Internal art/sfx generation-tooling tree (manifests, candidate seeds, generation
# provenance, raw pre-encode audio). Not read by the app; only public/art and public/sfx
# (the final encoded assets) are. Kept out of the tree that ships.
#
# Leading slash matters: a bare `art/` matches a directory of that name at
# ANY depth, so it silently swallowed public/art/ too -- every dashboard
# background, theme thumbnail, and the boot logo never got committed. This
# anchors it to this .gitignore's own directory, matching what the comment
# above always said it meant.
/art/
